ount\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:15\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:08:23\", \"token_count\": 478, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-35\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Benchmark Results\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Thread opened**: 2026-08-11\\n\\n**Last activity**: 2026-08-12\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-11 08:42] Evan**: The benchmark node finally got provisioned. Rerunning the scripts on real bare-metal hardware now instead of a stand-in.\\n\\n**[2026-08-11 08:44] Alice**: Good timing — glad that block is cleared.\\n\\n**[2026-08-11 08:47] Evan**: Full run is going. Should have results to share by tomorrow.\\n\\n**[2026-08-12 10:17] Diana**: Results are in. Since the multi-threading work is already done, I used it as the baseline for comparison — the numbers line up with what we expected from that work.\\n\\n**[2026-08-12 11:30] Alice**: Great. Are we publishing these as the official release figures?\\n\\n**[2026-08-12 11:32] Diana**: Yes — publishing now. Calling this done; it depends on the multi-threading baseline.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 35 slack thread benchmark result channel cipherdoc thread open 2026 08 11 last activ 2026 08 12 2026 08 11 08 42 evan the benchmark node final got provis rerun the script on real bare metal hardwar now instead of a stand in 2026 08 11 08 44 alic good time glad that block is clear 2026 08 11 08 47 evan full run is go should have result to share by tomorrow 2026 08 12 10 17 diana result are in sinc the multi thread work is alreadi done i use it a the baselin for comparison the number line up with what we expect from that work 2026 08 12 11 30 alic great are we publish these a the offici releas figur 2026 08 12 11 32 diana yes publish now call this done it depend on the multi thread baselin\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", 