ryption work, so I'm not touching that path here. Recording it and moving on.\\n\\n**[2026-08-10 10:56] Alice**: So we're calling this signed off?\\n\\n**[2026-08-10 11:08] Diana**: I'll close this out, but I want to be clear this is a preliminary offline pass — not a compliance certification. The 45-second hang is noted, not resolved.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 33 slack thread offlin batch run channel cipherdoc thread open 2026 08 08 last activ 2026 08 10 2026 08 08 08 58 diana har is readi so i m run a full batch through it with the network block at the o level kick off now 2026 08 08 11 28 diana batch is still run clean no unexpect outbound connect attempt log so far 2026 08 10 09 30 diana batch finish offlin sign off but flag one thing there s a rough 45 second hang at startup where someth in the licenc check reach for a remot endpoint befor it give up and fall back to the local path 2026 08 10 09 42 bob 45 second is a long time to sit there is that the encrypt pipelin licens check 2026 08 1010 54 diana look that way depend on the encrypt work so i m not touch that path here record it and move on 2026 08 1010 56 alic so we re call this sign off 2026 08 10 11 08 diana i ll close this out but i want to be clear this is a preliminari offlin pas not a complianc certif the 45 second hang is note not resolv\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee1382d28a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-08-offline-batch-run.md\", \"id\": \"194adb690b85ac78\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2829723108861862, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.10152131840883746, \"vector_similarity\": 0.70635796, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-08-offline-batch-run.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"docum